Equipped creature gets +2/+2 and has protection from mana value 1 or less and protection from mana value 5 or greater.
Whenever equipped creature deals combat damage to a player, that player sacrifices a nonland nontoken permanent and you create a Gear token. (It's an artifact with "{1}, Sacrifice this artifact: Untap target nonland permanent. Activate only as a sorcery.")
